OL,3,ANew data shows fall in visas, asylum
OL,4,Aclaims and small boat arrivals compared
OL,5,Ato year earlier
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome 16,000 asylum seekers were being
OL,8,Fhoused in hotels in June - that's 50%
OL,9,Fdown on a year earlier - with the trend
OL,10,Freflected across the country
OL,12,FThe number of visas granted for work,
OL,13,Fstudy, and families also fell - that
OL,14,Ffollows a tightening of the rules that
OL,15,Fbegan in the dying months of the
OL,16,FConservative government, writes Dominic
OL,17,FCasciani
OL,19,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood says the
OL,20,Fgovernment is "not complacent and there
OL,21,Fis more we must do"
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
