OL,3,ANew data shows fall in visas, asylum
OL,4,Aclaims and small boat arrivals compared
OL,5,Ato year earlier
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe biggest challenge for the
OL,8,Fgovernment now is the appeals backlog
OL,9,Fin courts over asylum decisions,
OL,10,Faccording to the Migration Observatory
